  "provenance": "Snapshot matches ill-solver start source except the scratch-only pipeline/device resource limit check in _metal_loop.mm. Extension was rebuilt from this source with clang++ -O3 -shared -fobjc-arc -std=c++17 and Metal/Foundation frameworks; the rebuilt binary is included. Every fit used this same checked binary. In-run source hashes cover the snapshot, panel script and hessian/logistic_gpu/sketch helpers; logistic_wide helper is included but was not separately hashed in-run. All source hashes recorded before/after match. Timing: two warmups and four recorded samples per variant; cyclic order; 2 seeds; sklearn centered float64 reference validated independently. Register and memory bounds were checked against pipeline/device limits before Metal dispatch."
